────────────────────────────────────────
error[S30]: An aggregate can't be nested inside another aggregate.
  --> dict.yaml:10:46
   |
LL |   - name: t
...
LL |       - assert: SUM(qty) FILTER (WHERE qty > AVG(qty)) > 0
   |                                              ^^^^^^^^ a `FILTER` condition is evaluated per row, so it can't contain an aggregate
